# Compiled binary (go build -o timingdex ./cmd/timingdex)
/timingdex

# Local Hub data directory: SQLite, cache, admin-token, agent-token,
# provider-secrets. Never commit — it holds the Hub credentials and the
# encrypted provider keys. TIMINGDEX_DATA_DIR can point anywhere, so the
# credential filenames are also matched on their own below.
.timingdex-dev/
.timingdex*/

# Hub credentials by name, wherever a data directory ends up. These are
# generated at first start and are the whole authorization boundary; the store
# key decrypts every provider secret.
admin-token
agent-token
provider-secrets/
store.key

# Real configuration. config.example.json is the tracked template.
config.json

# Worker configuration written by `timingdex worker enroll` (node token).
worker.json

*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Go test binaries (go test -c) and coverage output.
*.test
coverage.out
*.cover

# Media fixtures produced by hand while testing the pipeline. Source footage is
# never stored in the repo, and internal/media's integration test generates
# whatever it needs at run time.
/testdata-local/

# macOS directory metadata.
.DS_Store
